000010 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000020 PROGRAM-ID. FIGCMP.
000030 DATA DIVISION.
000040 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000050 01  H  PIC X(3) VALUE HIGH-VALUES.
000060 01  L  PIC X(3) VALUE LOW-VALUES.
000070 01  M  PIC X(3) VALUE "ABC".
000080 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000090     IF H = HIGH-VALUES DISPLAY "H=HV" ELSE DISPLAY "H<>HV" END-IF
000100     IF L = LOW-VALUES DISPLAY "L=LV" ELSE DISPLAY "L<>LV" END-IF
000110     IF H = ALL X"FF" DISPLAY "H=FF" ELSE DISPLAY "H<>FF" END-IF
000120     IF M < HIGH-VALUES DISPLAY "M<HV" ELSE DISPLAY "M>=HV" END-IF
000130     IF M > LOW-VALUE DISPLAY "M>LV" ELSE DISPLAY "M<=LV" END-IF
000140     MOVE HIGH-VALUE TO M
000150     IF M = HIGH-VALUE DISPLAY "M=HV" ELSE DISPLAY "M<>HV" END-IF
000160     STOP RUN.
